      "file": "src/mqtt.c",
      "function": "mg_mqtt_next_prop",
      "line": null,
      "code": "prop->val.len = (uint16_t) ((((uint16_t) i[0]) << 8) | i[1]);\nprop->val.buf = (char *) i + 2;\nnew_pos += 2 + prop->val.len;",
      "note": "The `MQTT_PROP_TYPE_BINARY_DATA` branch trusts the attacker-declared 16-bit payload length and advances `new_pos` without checking that `i + 2 + prop->val.len` stays below `end`. The fix adds that missing payload bound check before returning the property.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
